-- the field energy of a neutral configuration, in units of the line's own: the attracting count less the
-- repelling one, over τ(G); the difference is never negative, being the least of a sum of squares
field-energy : Nat → List FaradayLine → List Placed → QP
field-energy n ls ps = (monus (fst (config-terms n ls ps)) (snd (config-terms n ls ps)) , spanning-trees n ls)
